{
  "declaredLength": 2736,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "明明個性糟成那樣，\n為什麼還這麼強？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "660E660E500B60277CDF621090A36A23FF0C000A70BA4EC09EBC908490199EBC5F37FF1F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算是屬性相剋，\n我也一直輸得太慘……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C317B97662F5C6C602776F8524BFF0C000A62114E5F4E0076F48F385F97592A61582026202600100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且為什麼她是名流？\n什麼由紫特區，根本是耍詐。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E1470BA4EC09EBC5979662F540D6D41FF1F000A4EC09EBC75317D2B72795340FF0C6839672C662F800D8A50300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "春紫。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66257D2B300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "個性糟……\n耍詐……那些話是什麼意思呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "500B60277CDF20262026000A800D8A502026202690A34E9B8A71662F4EC09EBC610F601D5462FF1F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "欸！呃？\n您聽到的話變那樣嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B38FF015443FF1F000A60A8807D523076848A718B8A90A36A2355CEFF1F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "全像投影通訊器的狀態不太好呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "516850CF62955F71901A8A0A5668768472C0614B4E0D592A597D5462300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是說您的攻擊總是又正確又強，\n由紫特區真是個玩～耍的好地方，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我在自言自語罷了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F8AAA60A87684653B64CA7E3D662F53C86B6378BA53C85F37FF0C000A75317D2B72795340771F662F500B73A9FF5E800D7684597D573065B9FF0C00100001BE00000A6211572881EA8A0081EA8A9E7F774E86300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原來如此。\n妳意思是一切都怪全像的狀態不好。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F4F8659826B643002000A59B3610F601D662F4E00520790FD602A516850CF768472C0614B4E0D597D300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是沒有全像投影通訊器，\n我聽到的是個性糟和耍詐呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F6C926709516850CF62955F71901A8A0A5668FF0C000A6211807D52307684662F500B60277CDF548C800D8A505462300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊哇哇……我壓抑住的真心話\n漏了一點點出來而已！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A54C754C720262026621158D362914F4F7684771F5FC38A71000A6F0F4E864E009EDE9EDE51FA4F86800C5DF2FF01FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要打場寶可夢對戰，\n那些嘀嘀咕咕就會咻地消失的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8981625358345BF653EF59225C0D6230FF0C000A90A34E9B56005600549554955C31670354BB57306D8859317684300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來有必要讓妳明白明白。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F8667095FC589818B9359B3660E767D660E767D300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼春紫，\n我和<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐同心協力，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n和妳來場戰鬥。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBC66257D2BFF0C000A6211548C001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0540C5FC35354529BFF0C00100001BE00000A548C59B34F86583462309B25300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐，沒問題吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF0C6C92554F984C5427FF1F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "開始吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "958B59CB5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等等！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B497B49FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "同伴是我，對手也是我！\n這狀況真是出色到極點！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n只能打一場了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "540C4F34662F6211FF0C5C0D624B4E5F662F6211FF01000A901972C06CC1771F662F51FA8272523069759EDEFF0100100001BE00000A53EA80FD62534E0058344E86FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不論對手或同伴都是我，\n真是場名流才能享有的勝負！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8AD65C0D624B6216540C4F3490FD662F6211FF0C000A771F662F5834540D6D41624D80FD4EAB6709768452DD8CA0FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐，\n請和全像的我對戰。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF0C000A8ACB548C516850CF768462115C0D6230300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對戰的話，說不定由紫小姐的\n記憶也會飛到天邊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D623076848A71FF0C8AAA4E0D5B9A75317D2B5C0F59D07684000A8A1861B64E5F670398DB52305929908AFF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來對戰吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F865C0D62305427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "竟然吊人胃口……\n我等著<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的正面答覆！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ADF7136540A4EBA80C353E320262026000A62117B49845700100003110000FF01014F6059B376846B6397627B548986FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這一邊有春紫在，\n也就是說勝利會屬於我們的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E00908A670966257D2B5728FF0C000A4E5F5C31662F8AAA52DD522967035C6C65BC621150117684FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳就當作幫幫我，來對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35C3175764F5C5E6B5E6B6211FF0C4F865C0D62305427FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好！只要集中攻擊由紫小姐，\n說不定這一切的事情都能當作是沒發生過。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597DFF0153EA898196C64E2D653B64CA75317D2B5C0F59D0FF0C000A8AAA4E0D5B9A90194E00520776844E8B60C590FD80FD75764F5C662F6C92767C751F904E300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐同一隊的話，\n哪怕對手是全世界，通通都能對付的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0540C4E00968A76848A71FF0C000A54EA60155C0D624B662F51684E16754CFF0C901A901A90FD80FD5C0D4ED87684FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "引導大家是我們名流的責任，\n皮可西！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F155C0E59275BB6662F62115011540D6D4176848CAC4EFBFF0C000A76AE53EF897FFF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "該拿出我們的絕招了！\n毒藻龍！超級進化然後大幹一場吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A7262FF51FA6211501176847D5562DB4E86FF01000A6BD285FB9F8DFF018D857D1A9032531671365F8C59275E794E0058345427FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "全像的我也能使用超級進化，\n真是不可思議！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "516850CF768462114E5F80FD4F7F75288D857D1A90325316FF0C000A771F662F4E0D53EF601D8B70FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這是理所當然的勝利！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019662F7406624075767136768452DD5229FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "春紫會抱怨，\n是因為她不滿意現狀。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66257D2B670362B16028FF0C000A662F56E070BA59794E0D6EFF610F73FE72C0300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是她和我在一起，\n卻不幸福的理由我無法理解。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F5979548C621157284E008D77FF0C000A537B4E0D5E78798F768474067531621171216CD5740689E3300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "贏不過由紫小姐，\n讓我對自己的不滿……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D0F4E0D904E75317D2B5C0F59D0FF0C000A8B9362115C0D81EA5DF176844E0D6EFF2026202600100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好像用奇怪的方式發洩了出來……\n我會更精進的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D50CF75285947602A768465B95F0F767C6D294E8651FA4F8620262026000A6211670366F47CBE90327684300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那樣的話，\n我們就來做更多更多的特訓吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A36A2376848A71FF0C000A621150115C314F86505A66F4591A66F4591A768472798A135427FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "妳和全像的我還有我對戰的話，\n一定能獲得鍛鍊，變得更強！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59B3548C516850CF768462119084670962115C0D623076848A71FF0C000A4E005B9A80FD73725F97935B934AFF0C8B8A5F9766F45F37FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐，\n這是感謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫忙的謝禮。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF0C000A9019662F611F8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B5FD976848B1D79AE300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>獲得了\n另一種顏色的由紫裝扮洋裝！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000073725F974E86000A53E64E007A2E984F8272768475317D2B88DD626E6D0B88DDFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
